OL,3,GNEWSAApple donations help cider
OL,4,Afestival go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonations of apples have helped a cider
OL,7,Ffestival go ahead after poor weather
OL,8,Fand heatwaves resulted in a severe
OL,9,Ffruit shortage for the organisers.
OL,11,FJersey Heritage said its apple harvest
OL,12,Fhad been badly affected, leaving far
OL,13,Ffewer apples available for its annual
OL,14,Fcider festival, La Fais'sie d'Cidre.
OL,16,FThe event at Hamptonne Country Life
OL,17,FMuseum on 17 and 18 October, recreates
OL,18,Ftraditional cider-making using a
OL,19,Fhorse-powered stone crusher and wooden
OL,20,Fpress.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
