OL,3,GNEWSAApple donations help cider
OL,4,Afestival go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FNicola Lucas, Jersey Heritage's
OL,7,Fcommunity events curator, said it had
OL,8,Freceived around 40 bags of different
OL,9,Fvarieties of apples, about a quarter of
OL,10,Fthe amount they usually used, and were
OL,11,F"really grateful".
